---
---

<section id="market" class="surface-mist border-y border-[var(--color-line)]">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-16 sm:py-20 md:py-24">
    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-12 gap-10 lg:gap-14 items-start">
      <div class="lg:col-span-7">
        <p class="eyebrow mb-3">Heritage &amp; market</p>
        <h2 class="section-header mb-6">A practice as old as civilization</h2>
        <div class="space-y-4 text-[var(--color-muted)] text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed max-w-xl">
          <p>
            Hair removal — epilation and depilation — is one of humanity’s oldest grooming practices. It has existed across nearly every culture since at least the Neolithic era for aesthetics, hygiene, culture, medicine, religion, and personal empowerment.
          </p>
          <p>
            Today millions seek trusted experts for smooth, confident skin in every major market. wax.contact is the global digital foundation for that demand.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <aside class="lg:col-span-5 space-y-6" aria-label="Market snapshot">
        <div class="rounded-2xl bg-white border border-[var(--color-line)] p-6 sm:p-8">
          <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-[var(--color-muted)] mb-2">
            Global hair removal market
          </p>
          <p class="font-display text-4xl sm:text-5xl tracking-tight text-[var(--color-ink)]">
            $14B–$32B+
          </p>
          <p class="text-sm text-[var(--color-muted)] mt-2">2025–2026 valuation · strong ongoing growth</p>
        </div>

        <ul class="rounded-2xl bg-[var(--color-ink)] text-white p-6 sm:p-8 space-y-3.5">
          <li class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-white/50 mb-1">Why it works worldwide</li>
          {[
            'Universal understanding of “wax”',
            '.contact implies trust & connection',
            'Works in every major market',
            'Strong B2B + B2C potential',
          ].map((item) => (
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5 text-sm sm:text-base text-white/85">
              <svg class="h-4 w-4 mt-1 shrink-0 text-[#7fd4bd]" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true">
                <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
              </svg>
              {item}
            </li>
          ))}
        </ul>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
